{
    "chapter_num": 13,
    "verses_count": 14,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Submit to Government"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let every soul be subject to the governing authorities. For there is no authority except from God, and the authorities that exist are appointed by God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore whoever resists the authority resists the ordinance of God, and those who resist will "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. receive"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bring judgment on themselves. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For rulers are not a terror to good works, but to evil. Do you want to be unafraid of the authority? Do what is good, and you will have praise from the same. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he is God’s minister to you for good. But if you do evil, be afraid; for he does not bear the sword in vain; for he is God’s minister, an avenger to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "execute"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " wrath on him who practices evil. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " must be subject, not only because of wrath but also for conscience’ sake. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For because of this you also pay taxes, for they are God’s ministers attending continually to this very thing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Render therefore to all their due: taxes to whom taxes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are due,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " customs to whom customs, fear to whom fear, honor to whom honor."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Love Your Neighbor"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Owe no one anything except to love one another, for he who loves another has fulfilled the law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the commandments, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“You shall not commit adultery,” “You shall not murder,” “You shall not steal,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits “You shall not bear false witness,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“You shall not bear false witness,” “You shall not covet,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " any other commandment, are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " summed up in this saying, namely, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“You shall love your neighbor as yourself.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Love does no harm to a neighbor; therefore love "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the fulfillment of the law."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Put on Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " this, knowing the time, that now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " high time to awake out of sleep; for now our salvation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " nearer than when we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "first"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " believed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The night is far spent, the day is at hand. Therefore let us cast off the works of darkness, and let us put on the armor of light. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let us walk "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "decently"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "properly, as in the day, not in revelry and drunkenness, not in lewdness and lust, not in strife and envy. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But put on the Lord Jesus Christ, and make no provision for the flesh, to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "fulfill its"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " lusts."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}